<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japan stocks via 10 firms.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japan stocks via 10 firms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through 10 foreign securities houses before the start of stock trading on Thursday showed a net buying stance of 6.7 million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors' sell orders totalled 16.2 million shares, while buy orders amounted to 22.9 million shares.</p>
